				)
				(justify left)
				(hide yes)
			)
		)
		(property "Note" "L12 draws the land pattern. THE CELL IS NOT DRAWN ON THIS SHEET AS A PART: in the assembled tag the CR2032's top face touches BOTH positive fingers, so P+_POWER and P+_SENSE are one node THROUGH THE CELL AND ONLY THROUGH THE CELL. Drawing a battery symbol across them would short two nets that must be separate in copper - and that separation is the whole mechanism by which removal is detectable on both."
			(at 45.72 41.91 0)
			(effects
				(font
					(size 1.27 1.27)
				)
				(justify left)
				(hide yes)
			)
