		(property "Note" "THE PART IS CERTAIN AND THE PACKAGE IS SUBSTITUTED. Marking 'N52832 CIAAE0 2102JK' was read off the die photograph by lane L3 - fully legible, three lines. CIAA is WLCSP-50 and NO COMPLETE BALL MAP IS SOURCED HERE - O'Flynn's table gives TEN of the fifty (D3, E2, F1, F4, G1, G3, H1, H2, H3, H4) - so this sheet uses the QFN-48 (QFAA) symbol of the SAME DIE. The netlist is right by signal name; the pin NUMBERS are QFAA's. Inventing 50 ball designators is what DECISIONS.md D9 forbids."
