		(property "Note" "SILICON CITED, LOW confidence, package CANNOT DETERMINE. REFERENCE-TEARDOWN says only 'op-amp (speaker/analog path)'. THIS SHEET DRAWS IT AS A UNITY BUFFER FROM A DIVIDER ON SPK_P INTO AN ADC INPUT, because that is the one role in a speaker path that needs an op-amp and costs no current when idle. IT COULD EQUALLY BE A MICROPHONE PREAMP, A CURRENT-SENSE AMPLIFIER OR A FILTER. This is the largest single reconstruction on the sheet and it is labelled so."
			(at 133.35 337.82 0)
			(effects
				(font
